{
  "info": {
    "name": "FIAP Fase 3 - Sistema Hospitalar (Microsserviços)",
    "description": "Collection completa dos 3 microsserviços do projeto FIAP Fase 3:\n\n- **scheduling-service** (8081): Auth JWT + CRUD de consultas\n- **notification-service** (8082): consulta de notificações (REST)\n- **history-service** (8083): histórico via GraphQL\n\nFluxo recomendado: rode a pasta **Auth** primeiro (registra DOCTOR e PATIENT e faz login capturando o token). Um pre-request no nível da collection garante auto-login caso o token esteja vazio. Em seguida rode **Scheduling**, **Notification** e **History** na ordem.\n\nRode com Newman: `newman run fase3-hospital.postman_collection.json -e fase3-local.postman_environment.json`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Auto-login no nivel da collection: se nao houver token e ja existirem",
          "// credenciais de DOCTOR salvas, faz login automatico antes de cada request.",
          "const token = pm.environment.get('token') || pm.collectionVariables.get('token');",
          "const email = pm.environment.get('doctorEmail');",
          "const password = pm.environment.get('doctorPassword');",
          "const base = pm.environment.get('schedulingUrl');",
          "if (!token && email && password && base) {",
          "  pm.sendRequest({",
          "    url: base + '/api/v1/auth/login',",
          "    method: 'POST',",
          "    header: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },",
          "    body: { mode: 'raw', raw: JSON.stringify({ email: email, password: password }) }",
          "  }, function (err, res) {",
          "    if (!err && res && res.code === 200) {",
          "      pm.environment.set('token', res.json().token);",
          "      console.log('[pre-request] auto-login OK, token setado');",
          "    } else {",
          "      console.log('[pre-request] auto-login falhou', err || res.code);",
          "    }",
          "  });",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    { "key": "token", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "Registro e login. O login salva o token JWT na variavel de ambiente {{token}}.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register DOCTOR (sucesso)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Email unico por execucao (Postgres persiste dados). Timestamp evita duplicidade.",
                  "const ts = Date.now();",
                  "pm.environment.set('doctorEmail', 'doctor_' + ts + '@fiap.com');",
                  "pm.environment.set('doctorPassword', 'senha123');"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('retorna token', () => pm.expect(b.token).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty);",
                  "pm.test('retorna userId', () => pm.expect(b.userId).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty);",
                  "pm.test('role ROLE_DOCTOR', () => pm.expect(b.role).to.eql('ROLE_DOCTOR'));",
                  "pm.environment.set('doctorId', b.userId);",
                  "pm.environment.set('token', b.token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" } ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Dr. House\",\n  \"email\": \"{{doctorEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{doctorPassword}}\",\n  \"role\": \"DOCTOR\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{schedulingUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register",
              "host": [ "{{schedulingUrl}}" ],
              "path": [ "api", "v1", "auth", "register" ]
            },
            "description": "Registra um usuario com role DOCTOR. Retorna AuthResponse com token JWT."
          }
        },
